Brawler credits

Everything in this game is generated by this repository's own code:
  models   tools/make-characters.mjs, tools/gltf-writer.mjs (skinned characters and their 25 clips)
  levels   src/level.c (stages built from scene nodes)
  sound    src/fx.c (every sound effect and the street beats are computed)
  fonts    the engine's built-in UI font (see the engine's NOTICE)

Third-party code or assets: none.

