  Quiver beat-'em-up template for Godot 4 (https://github.com/quiver-dev/template-beat-em-up), code MIT:
    structure of data-driven attacks and state machines.
  Battle circle AI, Tuts+ (https://code.tutsplus.com/battle-circle-ai-let-your-player-feel-like-theyre-fighting-lots-of-enemies--gamedev-13535t)
  Attack token pools, "Making Combat Feel Good" devlog (https://lghts.itch.io/iron-reclamation/devlog/1092177/making-combat-feel-good-fair-readable-and-responsive-ai)
